# Moddy Arena: every creature he wished into the arena helps in a battle. Before the battle he makes a cat with the
# Apprentice in the arena; three more wished creatures stand in for what a wish could make (a wolf that bites, a sheep
# that does not, a camel that is big), each with the tag the core puts on every wished creature, and a cow nobody
# wished stands beside them. In a wave each wished creature takes ONE role, chosen from what the game says about it,
# shown above it and told to him once: the wolf is a Fighter and goes for the monsters, the camel is a Tank and the
# monsters turn to it, the sheep is a Healer and heals him when he is near it and not when he is far. The cow gets
# nothing. When the wave ends every role stops: no sign, no role tag, no Resistance left on the tank. A creature taken
# out of the arena in a wave loses its role at once.
# He stays in the prep room behind the shut gate with Resistance V, so the monsters cannot hurt him; his health is
# taken by /damage (generic_kill passes Resistance) and natural regeneration is off, so only a heal can raise it.
# play-timeout: 1500
@intent in a wave every wished creature in the arena takes one role (Fighter, Healer or Tank) shown above it and told once; a Fighter goes for the monsters, a Tank draws them, a Healer heals him only when near; a mob nobody wished gets nothing; every role stops at the wave's end and outside the arena
@world flat seed=1
@continue-on-fail

@step arrive
@expect chat Welcome to Moddy Arena within 90s
@wait 2s
difficulty normal
gamemode survival
gamerule naturalRegeneration false
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 1500 4 true
scoreboard objectives add hp health

@step before the battle he makes a cat in the arena
# into the arena through the gate, as in 2-wish-in-the-arena
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos 0.5 64.5 16.5
@key key.use
@wait 10t
@aim look 180 0
@key key.forward hold 45t
@wait 10t
@assert execute if entity @s[z=-15,dz=29]
@aim look 180 12
@wait 2s
moddy apprentice a cat
@expect screen Container within 10s
@click slot 0
@expect chat /is ready/ within 90s
@wait 3s
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=wishmob,type=!minecraft:text_display,type=!minecraft:item_display,type=!minecraft:block_display,x=-16,y=60,z=-16,dx=32,dy=20,dz=32]
@shot his-cat

@step three more wished creatures, and a cow nobody wished
# SHORTCUT: as a wish could make them; "wishmob" is the tag the core puts on every creature a wish makes. Resistance
# keeps the wolf and the sheep alive through the test (it is not what the test measures); the camel gets none, so the
# Resistance it has later is the Tank's own.
summon minecraft:wolf -2 64 6 {Tags:["wishmob","standin"],PersistenceRequired:1b,CustomName:"Rex"}
summon minecraft:sheep -3 64 12 {Tags:["wishmob","standin"],PersistenceRequired:1b,CustomName:"Puff"}
summon minecraft:camel 4 64 9 {Tags:["wishmob","standin"],PersistenceRequired:1b,CustomName:"Hump"}
summon minecraft:cow -8 64 10 {Tags:["bystander"],PersistenceRequired:1b}
effect give @e[type=minecraft:wolf,tag=standin] minecraft:resistance 1500 4 true
effect give @e[type=minecraft:sheep,tag=standin] minecraft:resistance 1500 4 true
@wait 1s
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_role]
# back in the prep room, the gate shut behind him
teleport @s 0.5 64 19.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@aim pos 0.5 64.5 16.5
@key key.use
@wait 10t
@assert execute if block 0 64 16 minecraft:oak_fence_gate[open=false]

@step he starts the battle; each wished creature takes its role and he is told once
teleport @s 0.5 64 21.5 180 0
@wait 10t
@key key.forward hold 15t
@wait 1s
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@key key.use
@expect chat A battle is starting within 5s
@expect chat Creatures you wished into the arena help you within 3s
@expect title Wave 1 of 5 within 15s
@expect chat Your Rex is a Fighter! It will fight the monsters with you. within 5s
@expect chat Your Puff is a Healer! It will keep you healthy. within 5s
@expect chat Your Hump is a Tank! It will make the monsters chase it. within 5s
# and his own cat, by the name the game gives it
@expect chat /Your (?!Rex |Puff |Hump ).+ is a (Fighter|Healer|Tank)!/ within 5s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:wolf,tag=moddyarena_fighter]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:sheep,tag=moddyarena_healer]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:camel,tag=moddyarena_tank]
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=wishmob,tag=!standin,tag=moddyarena_role]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_rolesign,nbt={text:{text:"Healer"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_rolesign,nbt={text:{text:"Tank"}}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_rolesign,nbt={text:{text:"Fighter"}}]

@step the cow nobody wished gets nothing
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:cow,tag=moddyarena_role]
@assert execute as @e[type=minecraft:cow,tag=bystander] at @s unless entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_rolesign,distance=..3]
@aim look 180 15
@wait 5t
@shot the-roles-shown

@step the Tank draws the monsters and stands up to them
# a monster that comes within reach of the camel turns to it: its target is the camel, not him
@repeat 600 until execute as @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] on target if entity @s[type=minecraft:camel]
@wait 1t
@end-repeat
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:camel,tag=moddyarena_tank,nbt={active_effects:[{id:"minecraft:resistance"}]}]
@aim entity @e[type=minecraft:camel,limit=1]
@wait 5t
@shot a-tank-holding-monsters

@step the Fighter goes for the monsters
@repeat 600 until execute as @e[type=minecraft:wolf,tag=moddyarena_fighter] at @s if entity @e[tag=moddyarena_wave,distance=..2.5]
@wait 1t
@end-repeat
@aim entity @e[type=minecraft:wolf,limit=1]
@wait 3t
@shot a-fighter-engaging

@step when the wave ends every role stops
# SHORTCUT: the monsters are not what this tests, so the wave is ended by command
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 1 cleared! within 10s
@wait 1s
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_role]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_rolesign]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:camel,nbt={active_effects:[{id:"minecraft:resistance"}]}]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:camel,tag=standin]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:sheep,tag=standin]
@aim look 180 15
@wait 5t
@shot in-the-break-no-roles

@step in the next wave the roles come back, and he is not told again
@aim pos 3.5 65.5 17.1
@wait 5t
@key key.use
@expect title Wave 2 of 5 within 8s
# SHORTCUT: the monsters are held where they appeared, so they leave the healer's test alone
effect give @e[tag=moddyarena_wave] minecraft:slowness 600 255 true
@wait 2s
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:sheep,tag=moddyarena_healer]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:camel,tag=moddyarena_tank]

@step the Healer does not heal him when he is far from it
# he stands at the back of the prep room, about ten blocks from the healer waiting at the shut gate
teleport @s 0.5 64 25.5 180 0
@wait 1s
damage @s 6 minecraft:generic_kill
@wait 6s
@assert execute if score @s hp matches ..14

@step the Healer heals him when he is near it
teleport @s 0.5 64 17.5 180 30
@aim entity @e[type=minecraft:sheep,limit=1]
@repeat 200 until execute if score @s hp matches 16..
@wait 1t
@end-repeat
@shot a-healer-healing
@assert execute if score @s hp matches 16..

@step a creature taken out of the arena loses its role at once
# SHORTCUT: the sheep is put in the prep room, outside the arena
teleport @e[type=minecraft:sheep,tag=standin] 3.5 64 22.5
@wait 10t
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:sheep,tag=moddyarena_role]
@assert execute as @e[type=minecraft:sheep,tag=standin] at @s unless entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_rolesign,distance=..3]
@assert execute if entity @e[type=minecraft:camel,tag=moddyarena_tank]

@step the battle ends: nothing is left on anything
kill @e[tag=moddyarena_wave]
@expect chat Wave 2 cleared! within 10s
@wait 1s
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=moddyarena_role]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:text_display,tag=moddyarena_rolesign]
@assert execute unless entity @e[type=minecraft:camel,nbt={active_effects:[{id:"minecraft:resistance"}]}]
